# A rectangle with a corner rounded by a tangent arc, extruded, and one
# top side picked with the mouse and rounded round the outline; the same
# as path_fillet_outline.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/fillet_outline).
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
click-entity 50002
key a shift
key esc
key x shift
click-entity 80030035
menu Features|Fillet Edges
